      "id": "conflict_1",
      "description": "Thermodynamic calculations predicted a positive F-effect for IN939, but experimentally no protective alumina scale formed; attributed to Al content being too low.",
      "source_evidence": [
        {
          "page": 3,
          "section": "Results of Thermodynamical Calculations",
          "quote": "Even for this alloy with a low Al-content a corridor for the positive F-effect was predicted for the temperature range of 900-1200°C similar as for IN738.",
          "table": null,
          "figure": null
        },
        {
          "page": 6,
          "section": "Results and Discussion",
          "quote": "Despite the prediction of a positive F-effect for IN939 the results show no difference between implanted and untreated sample (fig. 7). Beneath the chromia scale an internal growing alumina scale was formed.",
